      <p begin="00:20.780" end="00:23.920" ttm:agent="v1">I keep two hoes in my bed, I got 'em turning out</p>

      <p begin="00:23.920" end="00:27.180" ttm:agent="v1">What would you do if you heard I got it going on?</p>

      <p begin="00:27.180" end="00:29.960" ttm:agent="v1">I had to burn, I left skrt marks, I had to dip (I had to)</p>

