      <p begin="00:36.580" end="00:39.460" ttm:agent="v1">You cop it live, boy I got in on film</p>

      <p begin="00:39.460" end="00:43.030" ttm:agent="v1">You gotta watch out where you rocking, s***t get real</p>

      <p begin="00:43.030" end="00:46.260" ttm:agent="v1">Drink your real, I can't be fake, don't know the feel</p>

      <p begin="00:46.260" end="00:49.380" ttm:agent="v1">Gotta take a long drive up the hill</p>

