      <p begin="01:25.590" end="01:28.910" ttm:agent="v1">I keep two hoes in my bed, I got 'em turning out</p>

      <p begin="01:28.910" end="01:31.960" ttm:agent="v1">What would you do if you heard I got it, burned it all?</p>

      <p begin="01:31.960" end="01:34.750" ttm:agent="v1">I let it burn, skrt that mark, I had to dip (I had to)</p>

